# Tailwind & UI

- Use project tokens: `bg-ink`, `bg-paper`, `bg-soft`, `text-muted`, `border-line`, `bg-lime`, `text-lime`, etc.
- Breakpoints: sm 480, md 768, lg 1024, xl 1280, 2xl 1440, 3xl 1920. Design from 320px up.
- Mobile bottom nav visible below `lg`; desktop uses top header. Respect safe-area; never cover forms/CTAs.
- Card radius ~13px, buttons ~8px. Prefer borders over heavy shadows.
- No generic purple AI templates, excessive glows, or decorative gradient spam.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` for loaders/animations.
